<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BetzDearborn raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BetzDearborn raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analyst Robert Ottenstein upgraded BetzDearborn Inc to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- earlier the company said it expects continued improvement in sales activity in the third quarter as it fixes computer problems related to its integration of W.R. Grace &amp; Co's DearBorn business.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 1-9/16 to 65-1/4.</p>
</text>
